      en: ["Horten was granted town status in 1858 and city status in 1907.", "The first Norwegian naval ship built at Horten was launched in 1828.", "Borre Mound Cemetery is the first national park established in Norway (1932).", "The Preus Museum is located in a former naval laboratory building.", "Horten is home to a world-leading cluster for micro- and nanotechnology.", "The city is located approximately 80 kilometers south of Oslo."],
      es: ["Población: 27.000 (2023)", "Superficie: 70 km²", "Base naval establecida en 1850", "Museo de la Marina inaugurado en 1853", "Conexión en ferry a Moss: 15 minutos", "Punto más alto: Brårudåsen, 120 m"],
